{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51479","headline":"雨夜 · 李郢","name":"雨夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蛩声雨思夜迢迢，空馆何人问寂寥。\n寒烛细烟摇寝幌，湿萤微影缀芭蕉。\n正当孤枕鸿初过，况复穷居叶尽凋。\n闲忆秋江钓船里，洒篷沾浪听萧萧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51479.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51479","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}